:risk1 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Rolling object may cause sensor occlusion for autonomous vehicle" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential collision risk with vehicle following too closely in low visibility" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:weather1 a :NightCondition ;
    :description "Low-light urban environment with artificial lighting" .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.60"^^xsd:float .
```

